From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:00:40 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] meshcore: vendor upstream core library

Import MeshCore's MIT-licensed core (Mesh, Dispatcher, Packet, Identity, Utils, BaseChatMesh, helpers, and ed25519) at 81dbae59. Only the subset needed by the dual-protocol node is included; upstream's PlatformIO build script and board variants are not vendored.

